And I bet you want to come in my mouth at the end too, don't you?[p]
IH IH, you are such a little piggy![p]
You'll remember this for a long time, honey![p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua==2"]
